  data: {
    LLM: "1. Draw for lead. 2. Each turn: (a) add tile to either end of train, or (b) draw from boneyard (unless only 2 left), or (c) pass. 3. Doubles played across; not spinners. 4. Hand ends when one dominoes or nobody can play. 5. Score: lowest gets sum of losers' pips minus own total. Tie = no score.",
    Player: "1. Draw for lead. 2. Each turn: (a) add tile to either end of train, or (b) draw from boneyard (unless only 2 left), or (c) pass. 3. Doubles played across; not spinners. 4. Hand ends when one dominoes or nobody can play. 5. Score: lowest gets sum of losers' pips minus own total. Tie = no score.",
    objective: 'Be first to 101 (2p/partnership) or 61 (3-4p). Lowest pip total wins each hand.',
    gameplay: "1. Draw for lead. 2. Each turn: (a) add tile to either end of train, or (b) draw from boneyard (unless only 2 left), or (c) pass. 3. Doubles played across; not spinners. 4. Hand ends when one dominoes or nobody can play. 5. Score: lowest gets sum of losers' pips minus own total. Tie = no score.",
    keyRules: [
      'Three options: play, draw, or pass.',
      'Cannot draw when boneyard has only 2 tiles.',
      'Doubles across line; not spinners.',
      '101 target (2p/partnership); 61 (3-4p).',
